    "engine": "knitr",
    "markdown": "# R objects {#robjectschap}\n![](/images/RObjects.png){style=\"width:200px; background: white; border-radius:5px; border: white 5px solid\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\nIn the [foundations part](/foundations/intro.qmd) you learnt how to create a <u id='variable_tooltip'>__variable__</u>. \nThis consisted of assigning (`<-`) an __object__ a name. \nIn this chapter we will learn about __R objects__. \nThere are two major R terminologies to learn to fully understand __R objects__, <u id='class_tooltip'>__Class__</u> and <u id='data_structure_tooltip'>__Data structure__</u>.\n\n## Class\n![](/images/category.png){style=\"width:200px; background: white; border-radius:5px; border: white 5px solid\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\nA R <u id='class_tooltip'>__Class__</u> refers to the type of data.\nThere are six basic <u id='class_tooltip'>__classes__</u> in R (Also known as the __atomic <u id='class_tooltip'>classes</u>__). \nThese materials cover:\n\n- [**Numerics**](/objects/numeric.qmd): Numbers\n  - Numeric can come in the form of <u id='integer_tooltip'>__integers__</u> and <u id='double_tooltip'>__doubles__</u>\n- [**Strings**](/objects/string.qmd): Text\n- [**Logicals**](/objects/logical.qmd): `TRUE` or `FALSE` \n\nThere are also the <u id='class_tooltip'>classes</u> __complex__ and __raw__.\n\n## Data structure\n![](/images/data_structure){style=\"width:150px; background: white; border-radius:5px\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\n<u id='data_structure_tooltip'>__Data structures__</u> describe how data is structured in an __object__. \nWe will focus on 3 main types of <u id='data_structure_tooltip'>__data structures__</u>.\n\n- [**Scalar**](/objects/scalar.qmd): One value\n- [**Vectors** & **Lists**](/objects/vectors_lists.qmd): 1-dimensional structures containing multiple values\n- [**Data frames** & **Matrices**](/objects/data_frames_matrices.qmd): 2-dimensional structures containing multiple values over rows and columns (i.e. tabular)\n\n## Code sections\nIn this part, and for the rest of the course, you will use code sections in your R scripts to separate pages, sections, and parts in this book.\n\nFirst set your working directory to your course directory, create a script, and save it as __\"2-Objects.R\"__.\n\nNext create a code section at the top of this script called __\"Classes\"__.\n\nIn other words have the below at the top of your script:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Classes ####\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-42d4b5a22891dbadccea\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-42d4b5a22891dbadccea\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"operator_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"+, -, /, *, etc.\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-823a2f30ea20e54e1bc4\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-823a2f30ea20e54e1bc4\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"variable_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Container of an R object with a name\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-8e3b4954be2ceb1d7740\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-8e3b4954be2ceb1d7740\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"function_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Named block of code that performs a specific task\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-1881a5f1a9a7da54dfb5\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-1881a5f1a9a7da54dfb5\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"class_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object data type, e.g. integer, double, string, and logical\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-8aede69aea957b46f2b0\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-8aede69aea957b46f2b0\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_structure_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object structure type, e.g. scalar, vector, and data frame\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-623ce6a57d234caf59e7\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-623ce6a57d234caf59e7\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"integer_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number without decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-4784481a411a2ed45943\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-4784481a411a2ed45943\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"double_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number with decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-d2440d96ca3e7102f525\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-d2440d96ca3e7102f525\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"string_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Text\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-3090a19798eb0eada6ac\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-3090a19798eb0eada6ac\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"logical_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"TRUE or FALSE\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-37522e9324fae4a4b896\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-37522e9324fae4a4b896\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"scalar_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"A single value in a object\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-8cac66030e29d6f2a914\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-8cac66030e29d6f2a914\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"vector_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Homogenous 1-dimensional data structure\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-b387a4b59cd27dedda4d\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-b387a4b59cd27dedda4d\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"matrix_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Homogeneous 2-dimensional data structure\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-ac4f0d2bf7bc58ab49a6\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-ac4f0d2bf7bc58ab49a6\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_frame_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Heterogeneous 2-dimensional data structure. Each column is homogeneous\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n",
